---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/support-pages.css";
---

<BaseLayout title="NATE Exam Preparation | HVAC Training Solutions" description="Learn about Ron Walker's existing NATE exam preparation course for working HVAC technicians and ask about current enrollment.">
  <div class="support-page">
    <section class="support-hero"><div class="support-shell">
      <p class="support-eyebrow">For working technicians</p>
      <h1>NATE exam preparation.</h1>
      <p class="support-lead">Already working in HVAC and planning to study for a NATE exam? Ron has offered a separate preparation course designed around a technician’s schedule.</p>
    </div></section>
    <section class="support-section"><div class="support-shell support-split">
      <div class="support-heading"><p class="support-eyebrow">The existing course</p><h2>Study while you work.</h2><p>The archived course describes self-paced assignments, videos, practice questions with feedback, and help when a topic needs another explanation. It covers NATE Core, Air Conditioning, and Heat Pump exam topics.</p></div>
      <div class="resource-list">
        <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Short study sessions</h3><p>Course material is designed to fit around work hours.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Practice, then review</h3><p>Videos and questions help you find topics that need more study.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Ask about today’s course</h3><p>Textbook, availability, exam alignment, pricing, and enrollment details need confirmation before purchase.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="support-section support-section-soft"><div class="support-shell support-next-step"><div><p class="support-eyebrow">Interested in NATE prep?</p><h2>Ask Ron what is available now.</h2><p>We preserved this course address while the training site is rebuilt. Contact us for current details and to see whether it fits your certification goal.</p></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Contact Ron</a></div></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
